outer wall.  The room is quite plain, lacking any decorations or other objects

of interest.  A few chairs are stacked together in the corner, next to a bench

made from knotty pine wood.  It looks well worn and old, as the surface has

been made quite smooth and dull.  The floor in this room is nothing but dirt,

which is spattered with some kind of thick, dark substance.

