"Cylindrical Passageway - Upper Section"
"This cylindrical passageway is dimly lit from the light that seeps through the

floor board cracks in the store room.  A rusty, iron rung ladder runs the

entire length of the tunnel, with small handles on the side for gripping.  The

walls are made of soft dirt and pieces occasionally crumble off and fall into

the dark below.  A small trickle of water escapes from the trap door above,

dampening parts of the walls.  The air is earthy and slightly musty from lack

of fresh air.

