"Store Room and Bank"
"Cabinets crafted of several types of wood line all the walls in this room

except for one.  This wall is blocked off with a simple counter, wherein lies

the stronghold's bank.  A weapons rack reaches near the ceiling of the we

wall, with various size hooks and hangers to store various items with.  Near

the bank teller's counter is a massive wardrobe, simply crafted from cherry

wood.  The letters \"CoRD\" are embossed on the doors.  A look inside reveals

huge shelves and posts from which to hang and store armor.

